{
  "audioFile": "trend_vault_voice_1778959804079.mp3",
  "audioDurationSec": 108.878367,
  "source": "word-proportional",
  "captions": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "SCORPIO DOESN'T GO COLD. THEY GO QUIET — AND THAT'S WORSE.",
      "type": "hook",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.578743436781609,
      "duration": 4.578743436781609,
      "wordCount": 11,
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4578.7434367816095
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "THEY CAN LAUGH WITH YOU, ANSWER YOUR TEXTS, AND STILL BE QUIETLY DECIDING IF THEY TRUST YOU ANYMORE.",
      "type": "observation",
      "start": 4.578743436781609,
      "end": 12.087596333333332,
      "duration": 7.508852896551723,
      "wordCount": 18,
      "startMs": 4578.7434367816095,
      "endMs": 12087.596333333333
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "FROM THE OUTSIDE IT LOOKS LIKE INDIFFERENCE. FROM THE INSIDE IT SOUNDS LIKE A COUNTDOWN.",
      "type": "observation",
      "start": 12.087596333333332,
      "end": 18.344973747126435,
      "duration": 6.257377413793103,
      "wordCount": 15,
      "startMs": 12087.596333333333,
      "endMs": 18344.973747126434
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "SCORPIO READS EVERY ROOM BEFORE THEY SPEAK. PEOPLE MISTAKE THAT FOR ARROGANCE. IT'S NEITHER.",
      "type": "observation",
      "start": 18.344973747126435,
      "end": 24.185192666666666,
      "duration": 5.840218919540231,
      "wordCount": 14,
      "startMs": 18344.973747126434,
      "endMs": 24185.192666666666
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "BEHIND EVERY \"I'M FINE\" FROM SCORPIO IS A SENTENCE THEY ALREADY DECIDED YOU WEREN'T READY TO HEAR.",
      "type": "escalation",
      "start": 24.185192666666666,
      "end": 31.276887068965515,
      "duration": 7.091694402298849,
      "wordCount": 17,
      "startMs": 24185.192666666666,
      "endMs": 31276.887068965516
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "THEY NOTICED. THEY'RE JUST NOT TELLING YOU YET.",
      "type": "escalation",
      "start": 31.276887068965515,
      "end": 34.614155022988506,
      "duration": 3.337267954022991,
      "wordCount": 8,
      "startMs": 31276.887068965516,
      "endMs": 34614.1550229885
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "SCORPIO DOESN'T LEAVE DURING THE STORM. THEY LEAVE AFTER — QUIETLY, WITHOUT A SCENE, WITH EVERYTHING ALREADY DECIDED.",
      "type": "escalation",
      "start": 34.614155022988506,
      "end": 42.12300791954023,
      "duration": 7.508852896551723,
      "wordCount": 18,
      "startMs": 34614.1550229885,
      "endMs": 42123.00791954023
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "THE WALL ISN'T THERE TO KEEP YOU OUT. IT'S THERE BECAUSE LAST TIME, NOBODY STOPPED THEM FROM GIVING EVERYTHING.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 42.12300791954023,
      "end": 50.049019310344825,
      "duration": 7.926011390804597,
      "wordCount": 19,
      "startMs": 42123.00791954023,
      "endMs": 50049.019310344825
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "THE PART OF THEM YOU GOT WAS EARNED, NOT GIVEN. NOBODY TOLD YOU WHICH.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 50.049019310344825,
      "end": 55.88923822988505,
      "duration": 5.840218919540227,
      "wordCount": 14,
      "startMs": 50049.019310344825,
      "endMs": 55889.23822988505
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "IT ISN'T TRUST THEY'RE PROTECTING. IT'S THE VERSION OF THEMSELVES THAT STILL BELIEVES IN IT.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 55.88923822988505,
      "end": 62.14661564367815,
      "duration": 6.257377413793101,
      "wordCount": 15,
      "startMs": 55889.23822988505,
      "endMs": 62146.61564367815
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "THEY ARE NOT PULLING AWAY BECAUSE THEY STOPPED CARING. THEY'RE PULLING AWAY BECAUSE STAYING STARTED TO FEEL LIKE BETRAYING THEMSELVES.",
      "type": "truth",
      "start": 62.14661564367815,
      "end": 70.48978552873562,
      "duration": 8.34316988505747,
      "wordCount": 20,
      "startMs": 62146.61564367815,
      "endMs": 70489.78552873562
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "AND WHEN SCORPIO FINALLY GOES QUIET, THAT SILENCE USUALLY MEANS THE DECISION HAS ALREADY BEEN MADE.",
      "type": "twist",
      "start": 70.48978552873562,
      "end": 77.1643214367816,
      "duration": 6.674535908045982,
      "wordCount": 16,
      "startMs": 70489.78552873562,
      "endMs": 77164.32143678161
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "MOST PEOPLE SEE THE SURFACE. THE SILENCE. THE DISTANCE. THE WAY THEY SEEM UNMOVED WHEN EVERYTHING IS MOVING INSIDE THEM.",
      "type": "twist",
      "start": 77.1643214367816,
      "end": 85.50749132183908,
      "duration": 8.343169885057478,
      "wordCount": 20,
      "startMs": 77164.32143678161,
      "endMs": 85507.49132183909
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "IT'S NOT THAT THEY DON'T FEEL IT. IT'S THAT THEY FELT IT FIRST — AND ALONE.",
      "type": "twist",
      "start": 85.50749132183908,
      "end": 92.18202722988507,
      "duration": 6.674535908045982,
      "wordCount": 16,
      "startMs": 85507.49132183909,
      "endMs": 92182.02722988506
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "WHEN SCORPIO SOFTENS AROUND YOU, YOU'RE NOT WINNING THEM. YOU'RE BEING TRUSTED.",
      "type": "ending",
      "start": 92.18202722988507,
      "end": 97.18792916091955,
      "duration": 5.0059019310344866,
      "wordCount": 12,
      "startMs": 92182.02722988506,
      "endMs": 97187.92916091955
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "BUT THE REALITY IS FAR MORE COMPLICATED THAN THAT.",
      "type": "ending",
      "start": 97.18792916091955,
      "end": 100.94235560919542,
      "duration": 3.754426448275865,
      "wordCount": 9,
      "startMs": 97187.92916091955,
      "endMs": 100942.35560919542
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "AND WHEN SCORPIO FINALLY LOWERS THAT WALL — EVEN SLIGHTLY — TREAT IT LIKE THE RARE THING IT IS.",
      "type": "ending",
      "start": 100.94235560919542,
      "end": 108.86836699999999,
      "duration": 7.926011390804575,
      "wordCount": 19,
      "startMs": 100942.35560919542,
      "endMs": 108868.367
    }
  ]
}